This package is one of two implementations of one language. Its sibling, the
Elixir one, and the specification that arbitrates between them live in the same
repository: https://github.com/neutrino38/finite-state-language

The copyright range starts in 2024 because part of the Elixir sibling predates
this package: the language began inside Elixip
(https://github.com/neutrino38/elixip) and was extracted on 2026-09-12,
relicensed from BUSL-1.1 to Apache-2.0 by its copyright holder so that both
implementations ship under one licence.

Most commits in this repository carry the author address emmanuel.buu@ives.fr,
a work address of the person named above. The copyright holder is as stated
above.
